10:["$","p",null,{"className":"overview-body","children":"Rather than accumulating a scattered, capital-dilutive acreage portfolio, BluEnergies concentrates technical resources and balance sheet focus on the under-explored Harper Basin, offshore southern Liberia. Through Reconnaissance Licence RL-003, the company partners with global energy supermajor TotalEnergies to systematically de-risk multi-billion-barrel prospective resource targets across 8,924 km² of undrilled Cretaceous turbidite fan complexes."}]
